1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,696
Tiles you can't use don't just disappear.

2
00:00:03,016 --> 00:00:05,511
They fall to your floor line, and cost points.

3
00:00:06,533 --> 00:00:08,112
This is Ana's floor line.

4
00:00:08,432 --> 00:00:09,989
It has seven spaces.

5
00:00:11,099 --> 00:00:13,489
Under each space is a minus number.

6
00:00:13,809 --> 00:00:15,537
Minus means points you lose.

7
00:00:16,666 --> 00:00:18,522
The first two say minus one.

8
00:00:18,842 --> 00:00:20,634
The next three say minus two.

9
00:00:20,954 --> 00:00:22,746
The last two say minus three.

10
00:00:25,083 --> 00:00:26,981
Ana takes three black tiles.

11
00:00:27,301 --> 00:00:29,200
None of her lines can take black.

12
00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:31,184
So they go to the floor line.

13
00:00:32,299 --> 00:00:34,859
Tiles fill the floor line from left to right.

14
00:00:35,966 --> 00:00:39,209
When the round ends, add up the numbers under your tiles.

15
00:00:39,529 --> 00:00:41,086
You lose that many points.

16
00:00:42,199 --> 00:00:45,399
So these three tiles cost one, plus one, plus two.

17
00:00:45,719 --> 00:00:46,935
That's four points.

18
00:00:48,949 --> 00:00:51,872
Later, Ana is the first to take from the centre.

19
00:00:52,192 --> 00:00:55,072
The starting player marker joins her floor line.

20
00:00:56,199 --> 00:00:58,781
The marker takes a space, just like a tile.

21
00:00:59,101 --> 00:01:01,746
Three tiles and the marker cost six points.

22
00:01:04,083 --> 00:01:05,896
Then she takes four blue tiles.

23
00:01:06,216 --> 00:01:08,221
Again, no line can take them.

24
00:01:08,933 --> 00:01:10,405
The floor line is full.

25
00:01:10,725 --> 00:01:13,263
All seven spaces cost fourteen points.

26
00:01:13,583 --> 00:01:14,373
Ouch!

27
00:01:15,499 --> 00:01:17,121
The last tile didn't fit.

28
00:01:17,441 --> 00:01:19,531
Extra tiles go in the box lid.

29
00:01:19,851 --> 00:01:21,366
They cost nothing more.

30
00:01:24,549 --> 00:01:26,085
Ana had five points.

31
00:01:26,405 --> 00:01:29,008
She loses fourteen, but stops at zero.

32
00:01:29,328 --> 00:01:31,504
Your score never goes below zero.

33
00:01:32,633 --> 00:01:35,598
After scoring, floor tiles go in the box lid.

34
00:01:35,918 --> 00:01:37,433
Ana keeps the marker.

35
00:01:37,753 --> 00:01:39,331
She starts the next round.

36
00:01:40,433 --> 00:01:41,329
Remember.

37
00:01:41,649 --> 00:01:44,038
Each floor space costs the number under it.

38
00:01:44,358 --> 00:01:46,470
The starting player marker counts too.

39
00:01:46,790 --> 00:01:49,137
And your score never goes below zero.

40
00:01:49,457 --> 00:01:51,483
Next: moving tiles to the wall.
